<title>USA: Clinton releases $39 million in disaster funds.</title>
<headline>Clinton releases $39 million in disaster funds.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Clinton Thursday released $39 million in emergency funds to help cover repair costs for federal facilities damaged by storms, the White House announced.</p>
<p>The previously appropriated funds will be used to repair facilities of the Fish and Wildlife Service, the Bureau of Indian Affairs and the National Park Service.</p>
